<title>UK: Sullom Voe oil liftings fall, most to N. Europe.</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe oil liftings fall, most to N. Europe.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brent Blend crude oil loadings from Britain's Sullom Voe terminal fell to 728,627 tonnes in the week to March 25 from 766,852 tonnes the previous week, Shetland Islands Marine Operations said.</p>
<p>Over half the liftings, 525,303 tonnes, went to British and other north European refineries.</p>
